{% extends 'VegaLiteAgent/improvement_step.jinja2' %}

{% block instructions %}
Add helpful tooltips for better user experience.

## Scope — Tooltips

Focus on:
- encoding.tooltip (array of fields with titles and formatting)
- mark.tooltip (only if needed for tooltip interactivity)

The spec uses layers, and every layer you update MUST carry both `mark` and `encoding`.
Even when you are only adding tooltips, copy the existing mark across.
{% endblock %}

{% block examples %}
## Examples (illustrative — field names below are placeholders, not real columns)

Bar chart with tooltips (in layered spec):
```yaml
layer:
  - mark: bar  # copied from the existing layer
    encoding:
      x: {field: state, type: ordinal}
      y: {field: avg_pcap, type: quantitative}
      tooltip:  # Add tooltips to existing encoding
      - field: state
        title: State
        type: ordinal
      - field: avg_pcap
        format: .2f
        title: Avg Power Capacity
        type: quantitative
```

Line chart with tooltips (in layered spec):
```yaml
layer:
  - mark:  # copied from the existing layer
      type: line
      point: true
      tooltip: true
    encoding:
      x: {field: year, type: quantitative}
      y: {field: value, type: quantitative}
      tooltip:  # Add tooltips to existing encoding
      - field: year
        title: Year
        type: quantitative
      - field: value
        format: .2f
        title: Value
        type: quantitative
```
{% endblock %}
